    <title xml:lang="en">Mekong Medicinal Plant Atlas: occurrence records of medicinal plant taxa in the Mekong River basin</title>
    <creator>
      <organizationName>Mekong Medicinal Plant Atlas project</organizationName>
      <electronicMailAddress>see the atlas contact page</electronicMailAddress>
    </creator>
    <metadataProvider>
      <organizationName>Mekong Medicinal Plant Atlas project</organizationName>
      <onlineUrl>https://github.com/subhadipban-lgtm/mekong-medicinal-plant-atlas</onlineUrl>
    </metadataProvider>
    <pubDate>2026-11-24</pubDate>
    <language>en</language>
    <abstract>
      <para>A derived occurrence dataset of 860 medicinal plant names reported from the Mekong River basin and the six basin countries (Cambodia, China, Laos, Myanmar, Thailand, Vietnam). It holds 153798 georeferenced records harvested from the GBIF occurrence API on 2026-11-24 and filtered to records with an open licence, a recognised basis of record and verifiable metadata. 16143 records fall inside the Mekong basin boundary; the remainder are country-level records from the six basin countries. Coordinates of species assessed as threatened or listed in CITES are generalised (3786 records). The records originate from 147 GBIF datasets and remain available from their publishers; this dataset is a filtered and generalised derivative assembled for the Mekong Medicinal Plant Atlas. Records were not re-identified and names are those supplied by GBIF.</para>
    </abstract>
    <keywordSet>
      <keyword>Mekong</keyword><keyword>medicinal plants</keyword><keyword>occurrence</keyword>
      <keyword>ethnobotany</keyword><keyword>Darwin Core</keyword>
    </keywordSet>
    <bibliographicCitation>Banerjee S (2026) Mekong Medicinal Plant Atlas: occurrence records of medicinal plant taxa in the Mekong River basin. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24525569</bibliographicCitation>
